    <h2>1. What is a Portfolio?</h2>
    <p><b>Portfolio = Your Online Shop Window.</b> Just like a shop shows its best products in the window to bring customers inside, your portfolio shows your best projects to bring clients and jobs to you.</p>
    <p>When a client asks "Can you make a website?", you do NOT say "Yes, trust me". You send your portfolio link. Client sees your work, your skills, your happy customers, and hires you. Without portfolio, you are invisible. With portfolio, you are professional.</p>
    <div class="note"><b>Rule:</b> Clients do NOT hire for what you SAY you can do. They hire for what you SHOW you already did. Even 3 small projects are enough to start - Calculator, To-Do, Weather App. Show them well.</div>
    <h2>2. LIVE DEMO - Example Portfolio</h2>
    <p>Try the project filter - All / Websites / Apps. This is exactly what YOUR portfolio should look like:</p>
