    <h2>3. 6 Sections of a Great Portfolio</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Section</th><th>What to Put</th><th>Mistake to Avoid</th></tr>
      <tr><td>1. Hero</td><td>Your name, what you do, 2 buttons - View Work + Hire Me</td><td>Do not write long story here - Keep it 2 lines</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2. About</td><td>2-3 lines - Who you are, what you build, where you are</td><td>Do not write "I am a hardworking..." - Show, do not tell</td></tr>
      <tr><td>3. Skills</td><td>HTML, CSS, JS with % bars + tools you know</td><td>Do not claim 100% in everything - Be honest</td></tr>
      <tr><td>4. Projects</td><td>6 best projects - Image, title, 1 line, Live link</td><td>Do not show 20 weak projects - Show 6 strong ones</td></tr>
      <tr><td>5. Testimonials</td><td>2-3 happy client words - Name + work</td><td>Do not fake - Ask real clients / teachers for 1 line</td></tr>
      <tr><td>6. Contact</td><td>WhatsApp button + Form + Email - Easy to reach you</td><td>Do not hide contact - Make it big and easy</td></tr>
    </table>
    <h2>4. Project Filter - JavaScript Logic</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="text">let projects = [</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">{ title: "Shop Website", type: "web", emoji: "🛒" },</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">{ title: "Calculator", type: "app", emoji: "🧮" },</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">{ title: "Restaurant Website", type: "web", emoji: "🍕" },</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">{ title: "To-Do App", type: "app", emoji: "✅" }</span><br>
<span class="text">];</span><br><br>
<span class="text">function filterProjects(type) {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">let html = "";</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">for (let p of projects) {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">if (type === "all" || p.type === type) {</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">html += `&lt;div&gt;${p.emoji} ${p.title}&lt;/div&gt;`;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">}</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">}</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text">document.getElementById("projects").innerHTML = html;</span><br>
<span class="text">}</span>
    </code></div>
    <p><b>Logic:</b> If filter is "all", show everything. Else show only projects where <code>p.type === type</code>. Same logic you used in To-Do List filter (Lesson 36).</p>
    <h2>5. What to Write in About - Copy This Template</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="comment" style="color:#94a3b8">&lt;!-- Replace Ali with YOUR name, Lahore with YOUR city --&gt;</span><br>
<span class="text">"Hi, I am [Your Name] - A Web Developer from [Your City].</span><br>
<span class="text">I build fast, mobile-friendly websites for small businesses -</span><br>
<span class="text">Shops, Schools, Restaurants, and Personal Brands.</span><br>
<span class="text">I have completed 10+ projects in HTML, CSS and JavaScript.</span><br>
<span class="text">My goal is simple: Your website should bring you more customers."</span>
    </code></div>
    <p><b>Why this works:</b> It says WHO, WHERE, WHAT, PROOF (10+ projects), and BENEFIT (more customers). Clients care about benefit, not about your life story.</p>
    <h2>6. Complete Example - Portfolio Starter</h2>
    <div class="code-box"><code>
<span class="tag">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;html&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;head&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;title&gt;</span><span class="text">Ali Ahmed - Web Developer</span><span class="tag">&lt;/title&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;body&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;header&gt;</span><span class="text">Ali Ahmed | Web Developer</span> <span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"#projects"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">Projects</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span> <span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"#contact"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">Contact</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/header&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;section&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span class="text">Hi, I am Ali - I Build Websites That Sell</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;p&gt;</span><span class="text">HTML CSS JS | 10+ Projects | Lahore</span><span class="tag">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;button&gt;</span><span class="text">View My Work</span><span class="tag">&lt;/button&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/section&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;section</span> <span class="attr">id</span>=<span class="val">"projects"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span class="text">My Projects</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;div&gt;</span><span class="text">Calculator - To-Do - Weather - Shop Website - Quiz - Portfolio</span><span class="tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/section&gt;</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="tag">&lt;section</span> <span class="attr">id</span>=<span class="val">"contact"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span class="text">Hire Me</span><span class="tag">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;a</span> <span class="attr">href</span>=<span class="val">"https://wa.me/923001234567"</span><span class="tag">&gt;</span><span class="text">WhatsApp Me</span><span class="tag">&lt;/a&gt;</span><span class="tag">&lt;/section&gt;</span><br>
<span class="tag">&lt;/body&gt;</span> <span class="tag">&lt;/html&gt;</span>
    </code></div>
    <h2>7. Homework - Build YOUR Portfolio Today</h2>
    <p>In Playground, build your real portfolio - Use your real name, real city, real projects:</p>
    <p>1. Hero with your name + "I Build Websites That Sell" + 2 buttons<br>2. Skills with bars - HTML, CSS, JS + your % honestly<br>3. Projects - 6 projects from this course with filter All / Websites / Apps + Live links<br>4. Contact - WhatsApp button (wa.me/92...) + Form that shows "Thanks, I will reply soon"</p>
    <p>After building, deploy it in Lesson 47 - Then send link to 5 people. That is how your first client comes.</p>
    <div class="box"><b>Remember:</b> Portfolio = Online shop window | 6 Sections = Hero + About + Skills + Projects + Testimonials + Contact | Show 6 strong projects, not 20 weak ones | Filter = If type is all OR p.type === type, show it | About = Who + What + Proof + Benefit | Contact must be big and easy - WhatsApp button | Update portfolio every time you finish a new project</div>
    <p><b>Next Step:</b> <a href="/lesson43">Lesson 43 - Landing Page</a> - Learn pages that sell one thing. High conversion, one button, one goal.</p>
